# Read by run-fynd.sh, not by the arbitrageur service itself (that's .env). Separate file because
# Fynd is a separate process with its own env var, not one this repo's own config.ts parses.
#
# Ask PropellerHeads (or whoever issued one for this project) for a real key -- Fynd's own error
# for a missing/invalid one is a bare "Missing authorization token" body, not an obvious
# env-var-missing message, which is why run-fynd.sh checks for this before even starting it.
TYCHO_API_KEY=

# Uncomment only if 9899 is also taken on your machine (see run-fynd.sh's own comment on why 9898,
# Fynd's actual default, collides with the Envio indexer's metrics port).
# FYND_METRICS_PORT=9899
